OL,3,GNEWSASex offences trial hears spilt
OL,4,Amayonnaise denial
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Army Cadets instructor accused of
OL,7,Fsex offences could not have spilt
OL,8,Fmayonnaise on a man's trousers and
OL,9,Foffered to lick it off because he was
OL,10,F"a chilli sauce guy", he told his
OL,11,Ftrial.
OL,13,FRylan Ray, 26, of Westgate,
OL,14,FPeterborough, denies several sexual
OL,15,Foffences, many involving children he
OL,16,Fmet through the Cambridgeshire Army
OL,17,FCadet Force.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
