OL,3,GNEWSASex offences trial hears spilt
OL,4,Amayonnaise denial
OL,5,
OL,6,FIpswich Crown Court has heard he was in
OL,7,Fa kebab shop during a night out with a
OL,8,Fman, who had allegedly been one of his
OL,9,Fchild victims, and had spilt sauce on
OL,10,Fhim.
OL,12,FThe man, who alleges Ray asked him for
OL,13,Findecent photographs when he was a
OL,14,Fminor, told police the defendant had
OL,15,Fsaid: "I can lick it off because
OL,16,Fthey're mine, can't I?"
